appreciate that you are using symmetry (although you violate American
crossword conventions by having uncrossed squares) I'm about halfway
through it, right now.  A couple of comments so far:

36 has a typo -- it should be "selspaji"
17d clue doesn't really make sense.  How is it "finti"?  Perhaps you
meant "lidne"?
25 was the only one I've needed a clue on so far.  I didn't get it
only having to fill in the uncorssed letter.

